@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-8">
        <h1 class="mb-1">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-muted mb-4">Last updated: September 2026</p>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5>What this platform is</h5>
                <p>
                    Tech Nova is a marketplace that connects startups looking for funding with investors.
                    This page explains what information we collect, why, and what happens to it.
                </p>

                <h5 class="mt-4">Information we collect</h5>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Account details</strong> — name, email address, password (stored only as a salted hash), and the company or organisation you represent.</li>
                    <li><strong>Profile content</strong> — the description, funding details, posts, photos, videos and pitch decks a startup chooses to publish; the preferences and investment range an investor provides.</li>
                    <li><strong>Activity</strong> — messages between startups and investors, investment requests, saved startups, and subscription or payment records.</li>
                </ul>

                <h5 class="mt-4">How it is used</h5>
                <ul>
                    <li>To run the platform: showing published startup profiles to investors, delivering messages, and processing investment requests.</li>
                    <li>To review new accounts. Every startup and investor is checked by an administrator before it can sign in.</li>
                    <li>To send transactional email — account approval, verification links and payment references. We do not send marketing email.</li>
                </ul>

                <h5 class="mt-4">Who can see what</h5>
                <ul>
                    <li>A startup profile is visible to the public only after its founder marks it as published.</li>
                    <li>Pitch decks are never publicly downloadable; they are available to the startup itself and to signed-in investors with an active subscription.</li>
                    <li>Investor profiles are visible to signed-in users only, never to anonymous visitors.</li>
                    <li>Messages are visible only to the two parties in the conversation and to platform administrators for support purposes.</li>
                </ul>

                <h5 class="mt-4">Payments</h5>
                <p>
                    Card payments for NFC business cards are handled by Stripe. We never see or store card numbers —
                    only Stripe's reference identifiers. Subscription payments are arranged by bank transfer and confirmed by an administrator.
                </p>

                <h5 class="mt-4">Cookies</h5>
                <p>
                    We use a single sign-in cookie to keep you logged in, and an anti-forgery cookie to protect forms.
                    No advertising or tracking cookies are set.
                </p>

                <h5 class="mt-4">Your choices</h5>
                <p>
                    You can edit or unpublish your profile at any time from your dashboard. To have an account removed
                    entirely, contact the platform administrator and it will be deleted along with its content.
                </p>

                <p class="text-muted small mb-0 mt-4">
                    Tech Nova is an academic project. It is not a licensed financial intermediary and does not provide investment advice.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
